---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Subscribe from "../components/forms/Subscribe.astro";
---

<Base>
  <article class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-12 px-8 py-10 text-xl leading-snug text-pretty md:px-9 md:text-2xl [&_h2]:border-b [&_h2]:border-ink [&_h2]:pb-2 [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h3]:mt-2 [&_h3]:font-semibold [&>section]:flex [&>section]:flex-col [&>section]:gap-6">
    <header class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h1 class="text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">40 for 40</h1>
      <p>The joy of just <strong class="font-semibold">making stuff</strong> again.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Anyone else feeling this?</h2>
      <p>Twenty minutes ago, you felt unstoppable. You’d just built something you couldn’t have made a year ago. You didn’t even type. You Wispr’d it like Al Capone in a smoky jazz club.</p>
      <p class="font-semibold italic">Hell yes!</p>
      <p>Let’s go on LinkedIn and show everyone my… then it hits you.</p>
      <p class="font-semibold italic">Oh shit.</p>
      <p>A teenager’s built an algo arbitrage bot on Kalshi making $36k/mo. At this rate, they’ll be podcasting on 20VC before I’ve finished my… OMG, did he just raise a $50 million Seed round?</p>
      <p>How does that make sense? That’s what the world feels like right now.</p>
      <p>We’re feeling it too. So what do we do with that? Get in a room. Bring some good people. Make stuff together.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What it is</h2>
      <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-6">
        <li><strong class="font-semibold">40 apps in 40 days:</strong> like a hackathon in public</li>
        <li><strong class="font-semibold">Live:</strong> Streamed on Twitch, daily shorts on socials</li>
        <li><strong class="font-semibold">How to participate:</strong> watch, interact, sponsor, or build alongside at home. Heck, come and build with us in person!</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This is a community and we’re going to bring the fun back to building</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p><strong class="font-semibold">To start</strong><br />Our website <a href="https://build40for40.com" class="underline hover:opacity-60">build40for40.com</a> starts with 40 problems from the community. Anyone at any time can add more. Starting at 40p, anyone can sponsor a problem they want solved throughout the 40 days.</p>

      <p><strong class="font-semibold">Choosing the day’s challenge</strong><br />Each morning at 9am, the problem that’s the most funded becomes the day’s challenge.</p>

      <p><strong class="font-semibold">Choosing the format</strong><br />Next, we spin a giant wheel: web app, game, ChatGPT app, WhatsApp chat bot, voice agent, or API</p>

      <p><strong class="font-semibold">Time</strong><br />We’ll also randomly select a time limit for how long we can spend on the day’s challenge: 3 to 8 hours.</p>

      <p><strong class="font-semibold">Did we ship?</strong><br />10 minutes left: did you commit to GitHub?<br />5 minutes: why isn’t the connection to Vercel working?<br />2 minutes: can you add one last feature?<br />0:00: is it live?</p>

      <p class="font-semibold">That’s 40 for 40.</p>
      <p class="font-semibold underline">Begins November 2, 2026</p>
    </section>

    <div class="sticky bottom-0 border-t border-ink bg-white pt-4 pb-[max(1rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/logo.svg" alt="40 for 40" width="64" height="64" class="size-14 shrink-0 md:size-16" />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <Subscribe />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
